OL,3,GNEWSAUniversal Studios to get own
OL,4,Asewage plant
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe first Universal theme park in the
OL,7,FUK will have an on-site wastewater
OL,8,Ftreatment plant, a water company said.
OL,10,FIn December, the government granted
OL,11,Fplanning permission for the park to be
OL,12,Fbuilt on a former brickworks at
OL,13,FKempston Hardwick, about six miles
OL,14,F(10km) south of Bedford town centre.
OL,16,FConcerns have been raised about the
OL,17,Fsewage output of 476-acre (192-hectare)
OL,18,Fcomplex, which is forecast to attract
OL,19,F8.5 million visitors in its first year.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
